              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\frac{1}{27})^{-\\tg x}\\cdot 3^{\\sin 2x}=(\\frac{1}{9})^{\\cos^{2} x}\\cdot 3^{3\\tg x}\"></span> . </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{7\\pi}{2};-2\\pi]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T09:31:38.922294+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><nobr>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; </nobr> <nobr>б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{13\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </nobr></p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T09:31:38.922294+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Решим урав­не­ние<center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\frac{1}{27})^{-\\tg x}\\cdot 3^{\\sin 2x}=(\\frac{1}{9})^{\\cos^{2} x}\\cdot 3^{3\\tg x}\\iff 3^{3\\tg x+\\sin 2x}=3^{-2\\cos^{2} x+3\\tg x}\\iff 3\\tg x+\\sin 2x=-2\\cos^{2} x+3\\tg x\\iff \\begin{cases}2\\sin x\\cos x=-2\\cos^{2} x\\\\\\cos x\\ne 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\begin{cases}\\sin x=-\\cos x\\\\\\cos x\\ne 0\\end{cases}.\\quad \\iff \\tg x=-1\\iff x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </span></p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Отберём корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{7\\pi}{2};-2\\pi]\"></span> .  Длина дан­но­го от­рез­ка мень­ше <span data-inline-latex=\"2\\pi\"></span> , по­это­му от­рез­ку при­над­ле­жат не более двух чисел, за­да­ва­е­мых фор­му­лой  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k,\\,k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .  Под­хо­дят число   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}-2\\pi=-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span>  и число  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}-3\\pi=-\\frac{13\\pi}{4}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
